# The market data's provenance records the SHA-256 of these two files' bytes
# (script_sha256). Pin them to LF so a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true
# hashes the same as the copy that wrote backend/app/data/market_data.json.
tools/market-lib.mjs text eol=lf
tools/fetch-market-data.mjs text eol=lf
